    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730701686257\" id=\"item-6728662af0b5eb351a0a1925\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-a8ba3ff1bf8b4b207246\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us : </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Four Generous Bedrooms:</strong> Each bedroom offers a cozy retreat with ample natural light and sophisticated detailing, providing a sense of warmth and tranquility.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Three Stylish Bathrooms:</strong> With sleek fixtures and a modern design, each bathroom is thoughtfully crafted to offer a spa-like experience, elevating daily routines.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Versatile Living Rooms:</strong> Whether for family gatherings, movie nights, or quiet relaxation, these spacious living areas provide flexibility to suit any lifestyle need.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Modern, Open-Concept Kitchen:</strong> Featuring premium appliances, abundant storage, and an island that doubles as a casual dining space, this kitchen is ideal for both meal preparation and entertaining.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage:</strong> A secure, attached garage offers parking convenience and additional storage space for daily essentials.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Entertaining Spaces:</strong> Step outside to enjoy the landscaped backyard, perfect for alfresco dining, barbecues, or unwinding in a peaceful setting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Built to combine style with practical living, 9 Bomber Lane presents an inviting home environment in a sought-after neighborhood. Close to schools, parks, and amenities, this residence offers both the conveniences of modern life and the charm of a welcoming community. Don\u2019t miss the opportunity to make this Whenuapai gem your new family home.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6728669bd2ec3809828d2e65&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;6728669bd2ec3809828d2e65&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730696809221_146800\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"672866c0e88480441901a2a7\"